    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Paul Reynolds are delighted to offer for sale this 3-Bedroom End-of-Terrace 'A' Rated home.\nLocated in the heart of the beautiful heritage town of Ramelton, on the banks of the River Lennon. Known as 'Flo & Oscars Cottage' this impressive three-bedroom end-of-terrace property offers comfortable accommodation in an established and highly convenient residential setting.\nRecently upgraded with air to water heating system this property is highly energy efficient and presented in excellent condition throughout. The property comprises three generously proportioned double bedrooms and benefits from a spacious south-facing rear yard, providing a wonderful private outdoor space and a natural sun trap — ideal for relaxing or entertaining during the warmer months.\nThe property forms part of the mature residential development known as Back Lane, and its central location places it within easy walking distance of the many amenities and attractions Ramelton has to offer.\nRamelton is renowned for its character and architectural heritage, with wide, charming streets lined with fine 18th-century Georgian buildings — a reflection of the town's prosperous past as a thriving port and centre of the linen industry.\nCombining excellent presentation, generous accommodation, a sunny rear yard and a superb central location, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers.\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all this property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 4.2 x 1.0\nTiled flooring. Pine staircase leading to first floor\n\nWC - \nTiled flooring. Comprising w.c and wash hand basin\n\nLiving Room - 4.5 x 3.5\nLaminated timber flooring. Cast Iron fireplace with pine surround and tiled hearth.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - 5.6 x 3.2\nTiled flooring. Eye and low level units with single drainer sink and tiled splash back. Built in electric oven and four ring gas hob with overhead extractor fan. Plumbed for dishwasher. Access to under stair storage area.\n\nUtility Room - 2.0 x 2.0\nTiled flooring. Eye and low level units. Plumbed for washing machine and tumble dryer. Door to rear of property.\n\nLanding - \nLaminated timber flooring. Airing cupboard with immersion. Stira stair leading to attic which is partially floored.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.0 x 3.0\nLaminated timber flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.5 x 3.0\nLaminated timber flooring. Built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.7 x 2.7\nLaminated timber flooring.\n\nBathroom - \nTiled flooring and walls tiled floor to ceiling. Comprising w.c, wash hand basin and bath with electric shower overhead.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>End Terrace Property</li><li>Constructed 2003</li><li>Total floor area 91 sq m</li><li>Very well presented throughout</li><li>Comprising 3 double bedrooms on first floor</li><li>Prime location on Back Lane Ramelton</li><li>Walking distance of Ramelton Village</li><li>Highly energy efficient property</li><li>Air to water heating system</li><li>Solar Panels to compliment the heating system</li><li>Wheelchair access to front of property.</li><li>Concrete South facing yard to rear, natural sun trap.</li><li>Enlcosed with mature hedges for maximum privacy</ul>"
      },
